  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the support to Consultative Group to Assist the Poor (CGAP) is: Advance financial inclusion to improve the lives of poor people

The immediate objectives of the support is to: Contribute to the financing and implementation of CGAP&apos;s new 5-years strategy 2018/19 - 2022/23, to expand and deepen financial inclusion of the poor.</narrative>
  </description>
